==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

